# Implementation Summary

<!-- SPECKIT_LEVEL: 3 -->

<!-- ANCHOR:metadata -->
## Metadata

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| **Spec Folder** | 001-playbook-standard-and-fleet-normalization |
| **Status** | In Progress |
